{"ID":"20240513083107-m9gi5mo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083107-m9gi5mo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083107-m9gi5mo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163108-45z65kz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163108-45z65kz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163108-45z65kz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:512,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:512\u0026#125;","title":"233","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115947"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513163108-45z65kz","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 799px;","id":"20240513163108-45z65kz","updated":"20240515115947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"187 H, K"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"超胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/27"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"糖尿病。近來四天全身水腫。胸悶重、短氣。上月去急診二次，因血糖大於六百"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 頭痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 落髮"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 大便一日兩次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 口渴喜冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 胃口過大，一直吃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 夜尿四到五次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 尿頻"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 但欲寐，總是覺得累"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 雙足溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 平時多身熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11. 睡不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12. 有汗出，身上有汗臭"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13. 四天內增重30磅"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→水腫"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈洪數"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→脈症相合"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅乾2、眼診 :"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陽明經熱"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石膏六兩  知母五錢  柴胡三錢  鬱金五錢  龍膽草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉五錢  烏藥三錢  黃柏三錢  生地三錢  天花三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當歸二錢  側柏葉三錢  麻黃三錢  杏仁三錢  桂枝四錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白芍四錢  生薑兩片  炙甘草三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10帖   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各喝一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.要開發表的藥要加炙甘草，否則會令患者心動悸"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.倪師在斟酌要不要用炙甘草，因慮及她有水腫，最後仍決定用之 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.白虎湯可用治中消，若用於中消則要去炙甘草 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.此人已經頻尿了故水腫不用小便解，而用汗解 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.此人可用越婢湯但主症為白虎湯，因她有中消，越婢湯中的石膏不夠份量 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.全身性腫可用汗解"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}